B.XJ=new A.i5("How does the fee contract work?","The request is the office fee contract (boleto/CNPJ). After registration, you download the app on Google Play to follow your accounting in real time.")
B.XN=new A.i5("What exclusive features does the app bring?","NFS-e and NF-e with real-time control, accounts receivable and payable, owner drawings, profits, payroll, income tax, cash book, AI assistant and support. The app transmits data to the office (CRC) when enabled. On plans with follow-up, a licensed accountant signs the books.")
B.XI=new A.i5("Basic or accounting plans with an active accountant?","Basic Individual Microentrepreneur (MEI): 12 installments of R$ 40.00. Basic Loyalty (MEI): annual cash R$ 456.99 (12 \xd7 R$ 40.00 = R$ 480.00, R$ 23.01 off). Self-accounting in the app. Plans with an active accountant: AI system and a licensed accountant signing the books. Essential is the most chosen plan for ME. Plan changes: suporte@perfectgestdev.com.")
B.XO=new A.i5("Is there a team of accountants?","No. There is one licensed accountant and an intelligent system; you follow everything in the app in real time (once enabled, the data reaches the office).")
